  "description": "These stocks already won the series. Here are the entry ranges I’m watching to start positions.",
  "body_html": "<p>Xometry, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$XMTR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  is now up more than 45% since our initial entry and we’ve added to the position three times as the trend continued higher. Rather than trying to predict how far it could run, we’ve simply let the trend do the work. Maybe this will be one of our 100% plus winners! Do not limit your winners… let them get out of control. </p><p>Naturally, the next question is: <strong>What’s next?</strong></p><p>I went back through our recent Midweek Movers winners and found 3 stocks that have my attention right now. I’m going to show you the entry ranges I’m watching to start positions.</p><p>Remember, these are ranges, not exact prices you need to match. I’m targeting larger trends that can potentially last weeks or months, so being a few cents, or even a dollar, away from my entry isn’t what matters. I’m much more interested in getting the setup right.</p><h4><strong>Here are the 3 stocks and the entry ranges I’m watching...</strong></h4>",
